abstract: >-
  A standard-library-only desktop application for reproducible inspection and
  quantification of one- and two-dimensional NMR spectra. It reads Bruker,
  ACD/Labs ESP, and JCAMP-DX data and provides processing, peak picking,
  integration, line-shape fitting, contour display, and a researcher-supervised
  structure-consistency check.
